  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往摩顿村村长的家（68.32）与村长法德（20.12）对话，获得【花蜜结晶的情报】。（此步可跳过）",
      "type": "optional-info",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆本任务有快速解法，具体步骤见任务最后快速解法",
      "type": "fast-route-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "◆若只去烧技能，则可直接参考任务最后摩顿村烧技能",
      "type": "training-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "◆德威特岛（492.426）处使用Lv.5狩猎可采集到【花蜜结晶】；【花蜜结晶】很难采集，附带会采集到【蕃茄】",
      "type": "gathering-source",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "◆持有【花蜜结晶】时，在德威特岛（492.426）处附近会随机遭遇穴熊和黄蜂",
      "type": "held-item-encounter",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "◆【花蜜结晶】、【古代种子】、【含月草】可提前准备好；采集坐标图：",
      "type": "preparation-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "2.返回摩顿村村长的家（68.32），持有【花蜜结晶】与村长法德（20.12）对话，获得【古代种子的情报】。（此步可跳过）",
      "type": "optional-info",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "◆德威特岛（456.175）处使用Lv.5挖掘可采集到【古代种子】",
      "type": "gathering-source",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "3.返回摩顿村村长的家（68.32）后院（11.5）与园丁卡普（9.14）对话，交出【古代种子】获得【生命果实的情报】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "4.前往村长的家地下室（26.8），向南走，持有【生命果实的情报】与守卫提米德（38.25）对话，传送至迷样的地下室。",
      "type": "held-item-teleport",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "5.通过黄色传送石（23.23）抵达边境走廊，通过边境走廊抵达时空边境，通过（36.26）处黄色传送石抵达时空隧道。",
      "type": "time-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "6.通过（21.18）处传送石抵达时间：100年后，通过时间：500年后的黄色传送石抵达时空边境（数百年后）。",
      "type": "time-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "7.通过（7.23）处传送石抵达边境走廊地下7楼，通过边境走廊抵达迷样的地下室（数百年后）。",
      "type": "time-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "8.离开迷样的地下室（数百年后），上楼至村长的家（数百年后），前往村长的家后院（数百年后），在（13.13）附近寻找生命果实，调查生命果实，交出【生命果实的情报】获得【生命果实】。",
      "type": "item-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "◆生命果实无实体图标，可用鼠标挨格查找",
      "type": "hidden-object-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "9.前往克瑞村雷兹医生的家（66.26）与退休医生雷兹（16.5）对话，交出【花蜜结晶】、【生命果实】获得【含月草的情报】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "◆持有【含月草】时无法进行此步骤",
      "type": "inventory-block",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "10.前往德威特岛（227.475）处进入翠格墓园，前往（20.2）处使用Lv.5伐木可采集到【含月草】。",
      "type": "gathering-source",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "11.返回克瑞村雷兹医生的家与退休医生雷兹对话，交出【含月草】、【含月草的情报】获得【海尔斯药水】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "12.返回摩顿村村长的家（68.32）与村长法德（20.12）对话，交出【海尔斯药水】获得【耳环？】或【手环？】，任务完结。",
      "type": "random-completion",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "◆【海尔斯药水】可扔给其他号统一去兑换【奖品】，节省传送费",
      "type": "transfer-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "◆【耳环？】鉴定后为【天使之泪】；【手环？】鉴定后为【魔力手环】",
      "type": "appraisal-result",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "◆【天使之泪】：Lv.5耳环、耐久180~250；生命+80~150；装备后获得称号“来自过去的人”",
      "type": "equipment-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "◆怀旧服【天使之泪】能力削弱",
      "type": "version-effect",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "◆【魔力手环】：Lv.5手环、耐久250；魔力+142；数值浮动；装备后获得称号“回到未来的人”",
      "type": "equipment-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "快速解法：",
      "type": "fast-route-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "1.【花蜜结晶】、【古代种子】、【含月草】收集完毕后，前往摩顿村村长家的后院与园丁卡普对话，交出【古代种子】获得【生命果实的情报】。",
      "type": "fast-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        27
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "text": "2.前往村长家的地下室，与守卫提米德（38.25）对话传送至迷样的地下室。通过各场景后到达迷样的地下室（数百年后）。",
      "type": "fast-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        28
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "text": "◆路程顺序：",
      "type": "route-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        29
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "text": "迷样的地下室→边境走廊→时空边境→时光隧道→100年的光阴-500年的光阴→时空边境（数百年后）→边境走廊（数百年后）→迷样的地下室（数百年后）",
      "type": "route-sequence",
      "sourceLines": [
        30
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "text": "3.离开地下室后上楼至村长的家（数百年后），前往村长家的后院（数百年后），调查地面（13.13）附近处生命果实，交出【生命果实的情报】获得【生命果实】。",
      "type": "fast-item-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        31
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 32,
      "text": "4.前往克瑞村雷兹医生的家（66.26），先把物品栏里的【含月草】丢地，再与退休医生雷兹（16.5）对话，交出【花蜜结晶】、【生命果实】获得【含月草的情报】",
      "type": "drop-workaround",
      "sourceLines": [
        32
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 33,
      "text": "5.捡起【含月草】，再与退休医生雷兹对话，交出【含月草】、【含月草的情报】获得【海尔斯药水】。",
      "type": "fast-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        33
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 34,
      "text": "6.前往摩顿村村长的家与村长法德对话，交出【海尔斯药水】获得【耳环？】或【手环？】，任务完结。",
      "type": "fast-completion",
      "sourceLines": [
        34
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 35,
      "text": "摩顿村烧技能：",
      "type": "training-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        35
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 36,
      "text": "1.持有【古代种子】前往摩顿村村长家（68.32）的后院（11.5）与园丁卡普（9.14）对话，交出【古代种子】获得【生命果实的情报】。",
      "type": "training-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        36
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 37,
      "text": "◆组队烧技能，一人持有【生命果实的情报】即可",
      "type": "party-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        37
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 38,
      "text": "2.前往村长家的地下室（26.8），向南走，持有【生命果实的情报】与守卫提米德（38.25）对话传送至迷样的地下室。",
      "type": "training-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        38
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 39,
      "text": "◆【生命果实的情报】登出消失；建议通过步行方式补魔",
      "type": "logout-warning",
      "sourceLines": [
        39
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 40,
      "text": "◆魔物情报：",
      "type": "encounter-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        40
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
